title: "sinc-power-convergence: code for the paper 'The sinc-power window of the NFFT does not always converge'"
abstract: >-
  Python code with mpmath that computes all numbers, tables and figure data in
  the paper "The sinc-power window of the NFFT does not always converge" by
  J. Keiner.
